WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.278 --> 00:00:17.681
classes ended, some students gathered on the field with their pets.

2
00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:21.584
"You may practice for the pet show now," Mr.

3
00:00:21.624 --> 00:00:22.485
Freaky announced.

4
00:00:22.505 --> 00:00:26.028
"What if we didn't bring a pet to school?"

5
00:00:26.408 --> 00:00:27.289
somebody asked.

6
00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:30.091
"You can help your friends," Mr.

7
00:00:30.131 --> 00:00:30.772
Freaky said.

8
00:00:31.676 --> 00:00:35.640
Winnie looked busy with a group of witches, so Ben searched for Mog.

9
00:00:36.781 --> 00:00:39.423
He found his friend working with his two-headed dog.

10
00:00:39.443 --> 00:00:42.806
"Watch this, Ben," Mog called.

11
00:00:42.826 --> 00:00:44.888
"Rex-Rex, sit!

12
00:00:46.729 --> 00:00:47.350
Roll over!

13
00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:55.237
Fetch!" Ben was impressed.

14
00:00:55.257 --> 00:00:56.798
"He's smart."

15
00:00:57.859 --> 00:00:58.620
Mog nodded.

16
00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:05.503
"I entered Rex-Rex in all three competitions at the show—tricks, obedience, and best pet."

17
00:01:06.524 --> 00:01:08.665
"I think he'll win a prize," Ben said.

18
00:01:09.386 --> 00:01:11.727
Mog obviously didn't need help with his pet.

19
00:01:12.647 --> 00:01:13.908
But maybe Waldo did.

20
00:01:13.928 --> 00:01:15.929
"Have you seen Waldo around?"

21
00:01:15.949 --> 00:01:18.691
"He took his owl to the science lab."

22
00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.552
"Thanks. See you later."

23
00:01:23.413 --> 00:01:26.275
As Ben opened the door, he heard a nervous shout.

24
00:01:26.295 --> 00:01:27.295
"Close the door!"

25
00:01:27.315 --> 00:01:30.537
"Okay!" Ben quickly pushed the door closed.

26
00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:32.577
"What's going on?"

27
00:01:33.277 --> 00:01:35.178
Waldo wiped sweat from his forehead.

28
00:01:35.198 --> 00:01:37.278
"I don't want Oswald to escape."

29
00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:41.560
Ben saw a birdcage, but there was no sign of a bird.

30
00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:45.060
"Uh I hate to tell you this.

31
00:01:45.441 --> 00:01:47.761
But it looks like Oswald already escaped."

32
00:01:48.861 --> 00:01:50.462
"No, he didn't," Waldo said.

33
00:01:50.482 --> 00:01:52.823
"Oswald is an invisible owl."

34
00:01:52.843 --> 00:01:55.443
"Oh," Ben said.

35
00:01:55.463 --> 00:01:57.984
"How do you know he's still here?"

36
00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:02.073
Waldo reached into his pocket and pulled out a cracker.

37
00:02:02.573 --> 00:02:03.773
He whistled sharply.

38
00:02:03.793 --> 00:02:05.954
"Oswald, come!"

39
00:02:06.354 --> 00:02:08.255
Waldo tossed the cracker into the air.

40
00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:11.075
Ben felt a rush of air and then—chomp!

41
00:02:11.536 --> 00:02:12.776
The cracker disappeared.

42
00:02:13.676 --> 00:02:14.616
Waldo grinned.

43
00:02:14.636 --> 00:02:16.397
"He loves those crackers.

44
00:02:17.177 --> 00:02:19.298
But he's not very good at obeying my commands."

45
00:02:19.898 --> 00:02:23.139
He held up another cracker, whistling twice this time.

46
00:02:25.179 --> 00:02:27.000
Nothing happened for a few seconds.

47
00:02:28.156 --> 00:02:30.337
Then Ben heard a flutter of wings.

48
00:02:30.357 --> 00:02:32.218
"Gotcha!" Waldo cried.

49
00:02:32.419 --> 00:02:34.820
He snatched the invisible bird and whistled again.

50
00:02:35.921 --> 00:02:38.342
With a puff of smoke, Oswald appeared.

51
00:02:38.362 --> 00:02:41.724
"Awesome!" Ben said.

52
00:02:42.324 --> 00:02:43.705
But Waldo was frowning.

53
00:02:43.725 --> 00:02:47.307
"When I whistle, he's supposed to turn visible immediately.

54
00:02:48.127 --> 00:02:51.970
If I can't get him to follow my commands, we're not going to do well at the show."

55
00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:54.071
"Do you want help training him?"

56
00:02:54.331 --> 00:02:55.051
Ben asked.

57
00:02:55.071 --> 00:02:57.300
"Sure," Waldo said.

58
00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:01.742
"I want Oswald to come whenever I whistle once—no exceptions.

59
00:03:03.923 --> 00:03:05.924
And he should turn visible when I whistle twice."

60
00:03:05.944 --> 00:03:08.565
"Got it," Ben said.

61
00:03:08.585 --> 00:03:11.566
"Oswald is pretty stubborn," Waldo added.

62
00:03:11.586 --> 00:03:14.787
"Plus, he likes to chase small animals and carry them off."

63
00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:19.989
Ben gulped, thinking about all the pets he'd seen yesterday at the pet show.

64
00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.351
Most of them, like Winnie's kitten and Mrs.

65
00:03:23.411 --> 00:03:26.052
Hubbletree's gecko, were pretty small animals.

66
00:03:27.212 --> 00:03:28.593
"Let's get started," he said.

67
00:03:30.455 --> 00:03:33.218
Ben and Waldo spent the next hour training the owl.

68
00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:38.022
After that, it was time to go to the gym for the pet show.

69
00:03:38.042 --> 00:03:43.768
"I'll meet you in the gym in a few minutes," Ben said to Waldo near the school's main

70
00:03:43.828 --> 00:03:46.430
entrance. "My mom is dropping off Sid soon.

71
00:03:46.891 --> 00:03:48.012
Good luck with Oswald."

72
00:03:48.032 --> 00:03:50.774
"Thanks." Waldo looked nervous.

73
00:03:51.475 --> 00:03:52.116
"I'll need it."

74
00:03:55.912 --> 00:03:58.813
Ben reached into his backpack for his volunteer badge.

75
00:03:59.854 --> 00:04:03.636
He slipped it over his head and then checked his schedule to see what he had to do

76
00:04:03.716 --> 00:04:07.537
first. A second later his mother and Sid approached.

77
00:04:09.438 --> 00:04:11.439
Sid was wearing a volunteer badge too.

78
00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:14.280
"Mom just signed me up as a junior volunteer!"

79
00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.221
Sid said.

80
00:04:15.241 --> 00:04:17.222
"The office ogre said I can help you."

81
00:04:17.242 --> 00:04:19.703
"Great," Ben muttered.

82
00:04:20.723 --> 00:04:22.384
His mom gave them each a quick hug.

83
00:04:23.124 --> 00:04:27.508
"Remember, Ben, if Sid gets itchy or starts sneezing, call me."

84
00:04:27.928 --> 00:04:28.589
Ben nodded.

85
00:04:29.169 --> 00:04:31.651
He and Sid waved as their mom hurried outside.

86
00:04:32.252 --> 00:04:34.133
Then Ben spun to look at Sid.

87
00:04:34.153 --> 00:04:39.077
"Do you already have green spots on your hand?"

88
00:04:40.698 --> 00:04:41.779
Sid looked sheepish.

89
00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:45.542
"Yes. I petted a cute dog in the hallway."

90
00:04:45.562 --> 00:04:48.925
"I guess we're not getting a dog," Ben said.

91
00:04:49.466 --> 00:04:50.366
Sid shrugged.

92
00:04:50.386 --> 00:04:52.008
"Mom hates dogs anyway."

93
00:04:53.004 --> 00:04:54.505
"Come on," Ben said.

94
00:04:54.525 --> 00:04:56.587
"We have to feed some reptiles first."

95
00:04:58.548 --> 00:05:01.871
He led Sid to an area where some reptile tanks were set up.

96
00:05:02.631 --> 00:05:05.814
There were lizards and snakes of different sizes and colors.

97
00:05:06.954 --> 00:05:07.975
Ben spotted Mrs.

98
00:05:08.015 --> 00:05:09.276
Hubbletree's terrarium.

99
00:05:09.797 --> 00:05:13.519
Her rainbow gecko, Bowie, sat on a small branch inside it.

100
00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.341
Sid was staring at some snakes.

101
00:05:16.361 --> 00:05:18.903
"Ugh! I hate snakes."

102
00:05:21.036 --> 00:05:22.917
He backed away as a snake hissed.

103
00:05:22.937 --> 00:05:25.719
"I'll feed the snakes," Ben said.

104
00:05:25.739 --> 00:05:27.299
"You can feed the lizards.

105
00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.242
If you have any problems with spots or sneezing, let me know."

106
00:05:35.804 --> 00:05:40.507
By the time they were finished with the job, green spots dotted Sid's arms and legs.

107
00:05:41.687 --> 00:05:43.388
"Rats!" Sid said.

108
00:05:43.408 --> 00:05:45.169
"Yeah," Ben said.

109
00:05:45.189 --> 00:05:46.970
"You're covered with spots."

110
00:05:48.051 --> 00:05:49.612
"No." Sid shook his head.

111
00:05:50.464 --> 00:05:53.307
"I said 'rats' because I wanted to check out the rodents next.

112
00:05:53.707 --> 00:05:54.909
Maybe I'm not allergic to them."

113
00:05:54.929 --> 00:05:59.013
"Okay." Ben nodded and checked the time.

114
00:05:59.033 --> 00:06:01.716
"We might see some rodents at the pet parade.

115
00:06:02.236 --> 00:06:03.878
It starts on the stage in a few minutes."
